1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,408
Headaches keep coming back.

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:05,481
And by then, you've forgotten what happened the day before.

3
00:00:05,931 --> 00:00:10,091
HeadLog makes it easy to track your headaches, and what triggers or eases them.

4
00:00:10,541 --> 00:00:12,803
When a headache starts, one tap logs it.

5
00:00:13,103 --> 00:00:15,940
One tap for your medication, one tap when it's over.

6
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,925
Only the essentials in the moment.

7
00:00:18,225 --> 00:00:19,548
The details can wait.

8
00:00:19,998 --> 00:00:22,793
On a normal day, every drink is a single tap.

9
00:00:23,093 --> 00:00:26,869
Weather, caffeine, alcohol and your sleep are recorded along the way.

10
00:00:27,319 --> 00:00:29,461
A traffic light shows your headache risk for today,

11
00:00:29,711 --> 00:00:32,588
and warns you in the evening when tomorrow looks risky.

12
00:00:33,038 --> 00:00:36,593
Over time, HeadLog shows what's different before your headache days,

13
00:00:36,843 --> 00:00:38,265
compared with the days without.

14
00:00:38,715 --> 00:00:39,568
HeadLog.

15
00:00:39,868 --> 00:00:41,745
Free, private, and on your phone.

16
00:00:42,045 --> 00:00:43,368
Get to know your headaches.
